{"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.036563479443215363,"x":0.0096948991714995002,"y":0.0030709917281233068,"w":0.30293937683105465,"t":"@MirsIELTS","c":1},{"y":0.042862379430310238,"x":0.84775111054159802,"w":0.062197984059651712,"h":0.014565938201274164,"c":1,"t":"Test 3"},{"c":1,"w":0.72484598795572919,"h":0.013274336283185861,"y":0.089970501664783487,"x":0.075975363401247192,"t":"these find their way into the water system. Other sources include big pieces of plastic waste"},{"w":0.70855626424153639,"c":1,"t":"that are already in the environment, and these break down into microscopic particles over","y":0.1043443392534299,"x":0.075923517186355219,"h":0.016078254677201476},{"w":0.71252568562825525,"c":1,"h":0.013081395872223012,"x":0.078028738190250149,"y":0.12209302299184999,"t":"a period of time. On a larger scale, factory waste is another route, as are tyres which wear"},{"h":0.015105925478414828,"x":0.077957250956518231,"c":1,"t":"down as cars, lorries and so on travel along road surfaces.","y":0.13644727330402706,"w":0.4641897583007813},{"y":0.15988200573846945,"x":0.078028738557790883,"c":1,"t":"We already understand some of the impacts of microplastics from studies involving fish and","w":0.72073923746744784,"h":0.01308311079807345},{"h":0.019687931657189073,"y":0.17221135442783897,"x":0.075897323844855674,"c":1,"w":0.73736073811848957,"t":"other animals. There is evidence that microplastics harm small creatures in a variety of ways,"},{"w":0.70020533243815108,"x":0.075975362639858962,"t":"such as by damaging their mouths, or by impairing their ability to feed, for example when","h":0.016224188790560534,"c":1,"y":0.19026548646845953},{"c":1,"t":"microplastics get lodged in their digestive system.","y":0.20784883741472826,"x":0.075975359059140046,"w":0.39425051371256509,"h":0.014570041532713462},{"h":0.013121698880265931,"x":0.078028744340016665,"w":0.69815195719401046,"t":"Surprisingly perhaps, it is likely that humans consume microplastics, as these have been","y":0.22965116252181716,"c":1},{"y":0.24563953509072334,"h":0.014537456253636893,"c":1,"x":0.07597536243432719,"w":0.70020533243815097,"t":"detected in a wide range of food and drink products, including bottled water, as well as in"},{"h":0.016061782836914062,"y":0.25975029959154827,"x":0.0779735811983924,"w":0.73112019856770838,"c":1,"t":"water that comes direct from the tap. What's more, salt and many kinds of seafood have also"},{"t":"been found to contain microplastics.","y":0.27758112113526745,"w":0.28952771504720048,"c":1,"x":0.075975362079255856,"h":0.013116553540075016},{"h":0.015884380284312161,"c":1,"x":0.077971788607139172,"t":"However, it's important to underline that there is not yet conclusive proof that microplastics","y":0.29830910174380676,"w":0.71264328002929689},{"x":0.075975361807655642,"h":0.016224188790560423,"w":0.67556467692057298,"c":1,"y":0.31386430671273824,"t":"cause significant harm to people. In many countries, including here in the UK, there is"},{"y":0.32994186067029396,"c":1,"t":"legislation which prevents manufacturers from adding plastic microbeads to shower gels,","x":0.075975368938480864,"w":0.70225870768229159,"h":0.014600912448579084},{"h":0.01308825557562443,"t":"facial cleansers and toothpaste.","x":0.075975354612601978,"y":0.34738372066294931,"w":0.25462013244628906,"c":1},{"w":0.71068374633789066,"t":"It is very difficult to accurately estimate the total amount of microplastic particles in the soil","x":0.075883260913752984,"h":0.017723576368483873,"c":1,"y":0.36700143806201635},{"h":0.018220837348330243,"x":0.075893244685438219,"y":0.38295682227164152,"w":0.70448145548502605,"c":1,"t":"as they can be hard to detect, but we do know they are carried in the air and deposited in"},{"t":"the soil by rain. What's more, many of the fertilisers used by both farmers and gardeners","h":0.019171268609421199,"y":0.3976930874946476,"w":0.69837463378906239,"c":1,"x":0.075859788698350833},{"c":1,"w":0.17494982401529946,"t":"contain microplastics.","x":0.075793462967613009,"y":0.4158085145579884,"h":0.014534418561817253},{"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1,"x":0.8398357284356035,"t":"Q32","h":0.013081394746943475,"y":0.19040697700425357},{"x":0.83983572844164278,"t":"Q33","w":0.036960986455281564,"h":0.013081394746943475,"y":0.26017441886712334,"c":1},{"x":0.83778234047580535,"w":0.04106776237487797,"h":0.013081394746943475,"y":0.33284883747391203,"t":"Q34","c":1},{"x":0.83778234041623367,"w":0.039014374415079711,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"y":0.399709302590191,"t":"Q35"},{"y":0.45833567223867955,"x":0.075897904825917337,"w":0.72706466674804693,"c":1,"t":"A team from the Anglia Ruskin University in Cambridge has carried out a study of the effects","h":0.018031340292421483},{"t":"of microplastics on the digestive tracts of earthworms. These worms, which live in topsoil, are","w":0.73529978434244792,"x":0.075894993987396339,"y":0.47366256458023814,"h":0.019721091391414314,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.49115044265816565,"w":0.72895278930664065,"t":"an essential component of our agricultural system. By feeding on soil, they mix nutrients into","x":0.075975350662337085,"h":0.014749262536873253},{"y":0.50726744206355445,"w":0.25872690836588541,"t":"it, thereby making it more fertile.","x":0.075975354742214826,"h":0.014561466340821783,"c":1},{"t":"The researchers set out to discover whether the introduction of microplastics into the soil","w":0.70020533243815108,"x":0.075975362547443748,"h":0.014588049379421819,"y":0.52906976764655622,"c":1},{"t":"- and the subsequent ingestion of these by earthworms - would impact soil quality and","x":0.073921967715115597,"w":0.68993840535481765,"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"y":0.54505813974072725},{"c":1,"t":"ultimately inhibit plant growth. The short answer was, yes, it did. After placing three different","y":0.55914088566695397,"w":0.72504704793294272,"x":0.075880119152324135,"h":0.018241119384765581},{"t":"types of microplastic particles into the soil, they planted perennial rye grass. The particles of","x":0.075919938683429111,"c":1,"w":0.72702148437500003,"h":0.01659076656915448,"y":0.57503634318133867},{"t":"microplastic, which included biodegradable PLA and conventional high-density polyethylene,","h":0.017332487753358938,"c":1,"w":0.73109736124674474,"y":0.5904631009540463,"x":0.075924430838558793},{"c":1,"t":"or HDPE, were then ingested by the earthworms in the soil. The result was that the worms","x":0.075893647352066204,"y":0.6051871421320324,"w":0.71269495646158854,"h":0.018638204613969811},{"t":"lost weight rapidly. What's more, a lower percentage than normal of the rye grass seeds","w":0.69420211791992181,"h":0.017369398043922346,"c":1,"y":0.62154718364144945,"x":0.075902462619099248},{"t":"germinated, and the researchers concluded that this was a direct result of the earthworms","c":1,"x":0.075803635570437206,"y":0.63440116222467102,"w":0.71075256347656246,"h":0.019732612002212324},{"y":0.65250737463912822,"t":"being unable to fulfil their normal role in making soil more fertile. The team also discovered","c":1,"x":0.075975363076732,"w":0.71663243611653638,"h":0.016224188790560423},{"t":"that there was an increase in the amount of acid found in the soil, and this was attributed","h":0.014581189113380577,"c":1,"w":0.70225870768229159,"y":0.66860465136907854,"x":0.075975368893412568},{"w":0.53809839884440103,"t":"mainly to the microplastic particles from conventional HDPE plastic.","y":0.68344893818337582,"h":0.017293187369287533,"x":0.075908289170533674,"c":1},{"h":0.013095115841665894,"c":1,"y":0.70784883694504441,"w":0.71868581136067711,"t":"The conclusions of the study make for very interesting reading - I've included the reference","x":0.080082145569007251},{"w":0.71663243611653638,"c":1,"h":0.013081395872223012,"x":0.078028751036445104,"t":"in the notes to give you at the end of this session. To summarise, the authors proposed the","y":0.72383720903872584},{"x":0.075929043462274137,"w":0.73521118164062504,"y":0.73815644636490052,"h":0.016208661622354126,"t":"idea that we need to regard soil as we would regard any other process in nature. This means","c":1},{"w":0.69609858194986973,"c":1,"x":0.075975349619480992,"y":0.75427728635498603,"t":"we should accept the implications of soil being dependent on decaying and dead matter","h":0.014749262536873142},{"t":"constantly being passed through the bodies of earthworms. That is, when soil becomes","h":0.014585476990646384,"x":0.07802876345605872,"y":0.76889534880431554,"w":0.68788497924804692,"c":1},{"y":0.78488372104439341,"w":0.71252568562825513,"c":1,"t":"impoverished by the presence of microplastics, not only ecosystems but also the whole of","x":0.075975350158567878,"h":0.016001234926656949},{"h":0.014534883302221524,"t":"society are negatively impacted.","x":0.075975370391031027,"y":0.80087209305092411,"w":0.2587268829345703,"c":1},{"w":0.039485448201497353,"y":0.4892783591646217,"t":"Q36","c":1,"x":0.83857953814063535,"h":0.015740478425602666},{"c":1,"w":0.039014374415079711,"t":"Q37","x":0.83778234041623367,"y":0.54505813979949336,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"t":"Q38","c":1,"y":0.60901162816944887,"x":0.83983572850087895,"w":0.039014374415079711,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"y":0.66715116285470322,"w":0.04106776237487797,"c":1,"x":0.8398357285866882,"t":"Q39","h":0.014534883302221524},{"y":0.78633720956479769,"t":"Q40","x":0.841889116591228,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587,"w":0.039014374415079822},{"t":"113","x":0.87474332619741058,"y":0.91860465122679613,"w":0.036960986455281675,"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1},{"y":0.94166666658950615,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51176470218237247,"w":0.45294118245442705,"h":0.04166666666666663}],"h":3390}